<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Special Device upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Special Device upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it raised its recommendation on Special Devices Inc to outperform from neutral.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 2-1/8 to 17-7/8 in morning Nasdaq trade.</p>
